1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:11,139
Welcome to NGO Connect. This platform connects donors, volunteers, NGOs,
and admins in one transparent social impact ecosystem.

2
00:00:13,639 --> 00:00:22,952
First, we enter as a user. Users can discover trusted NGOs, donate
securely, volunteer in campaigns, and track their impact in one place.

3
00:00:25,152 --> 00:00:33,488
The discovery module helps users filter NGOs by cause, location, and
relevance so support decisions are faster and better informed.

4
00:00:35,688 --> 00:00:43,409
The map view adds geographic context, allowing users to explore nearby
NGOs and plan location-aware support and volunteering.

5
00:00:45,609 --> 00:00:55,350
Campaign pages show goals, current progress, beneficiary outcomes, and
updates, helping users evaluate where contributions create the most
impact.

6
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:06,234
The donation flow supports UPI, card, and netbanking through a
structured initiate and confirm workflow designed for reliability and
traceability.

7
00:01:08,434 --> 00:01:17,355
Users can browse volunteer opportunities, apply directly, and contribute
through skills, time, and on-ground support, not only donations.

8
00:01:19,555 --> 00:01:29,129
Dashboards and profiles summarize each user journey, including donation
records, volunteer activity, certificates, and overall contribution
tracking.

9
00:01:31,329 --> 00:01:40,788
Engagement features include direct messaging, smart insights,
personalized recommendations, and an AI chatbot to guide users across
platform workflows.

10
00:01:42,988 --> 00:01:53,875
Innovation Center expands participation through emergency response
feeds, giving circles, in-kind wishlists, gamification, endorsements,
and corporate matching workflows.

11
00:01:56,375 --> 00:02:04,727
Now we switch to the NGO role to see how organizations run campaigns,
operations, supporter engagement, and internal coordination.

12
00:02:06,927 --> 00:02:16,583
NGOs can manage profile data, publish campaigns, review volunteering and
donation activity, and maintain execution quality through structured
workflows.

13
00:02:18,783 --> 00:02:27,304
Campaign update tools help NGOs publish delivery milestones and track
supporter engagement, improving transparency and long-term donor trust.

14
00:02:29,804 --> 00:02:36,682
Now we move to admin controls where governance, moderation, and
platform-level reliability are managed centrally.

15
00:02:38,882 --> 00:02:49,571
Admins verify NGOs, moderate flagged content, monitor analytics, manage
requests, and maintain healthy platform operations across all
stakeholder groups.

16
00:02:51,771 --> 00:03:04,222
Behind the interface, NGO Connect runs on a React frontend, Express API,
and PostgreSQL data model with webhook reliability, replay operations,
and measurable delivery observability.
